id: super-saiyan-2-ascended-past-a-super-saiyan
name: Ascended Past a Super Saiyan
order: 2
slot: mastery
mastery: 1
# Its [Permanent] effects: they hold outside the Transformation too.
permanent: 1
# (1) Power High and a level of Draining lost.
aspects: -Power High, -Draining (LV1)
description: >
  You have reined in the rampant power of this form, making it your own.
text: >
  Ascended Past a Super Saiyan (1): You have reined in the rampant power of this form, making it your own.
  (1)-[Permanent]: Super Saiyan 2 loses both the Power High Aspect and 1 level of the Draining Aspect.
  (2)-[Passive]: Increase the Dice Score of your Steadfast Checks by 1.
  (3)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you succeed at a Steadfast Check, regain Ki Points equal to your Surgency.

---

# (2) Steadfast Checks 1 higher.
[passive, effect 2]
steadfast.dice += 1;

# (3) Ki Points with a Steadfast Check passed: the table's.
